      <url>/2026/10/17/hello-world/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="欢迎使用-Hexo！"><a href="#欢迎使用-Hexo！" class="headerlink" title="欢迎使用 Hexo！"></a>欢迎使用 <a href="https://hexo.io/">Hexo</a>！</h1><p>这是系统层面的第一篇博客文章，因此特意翻译成中文并保留。想了解更多信息，请查阅<a href="https://hexo.io/docs/">官方文档</a>。如果在使用 Hexo 的过程中遇到问题，可以在<a href="https://hexo.io/docs/troubleshooting.html">故障排除</a>页面寻找答案，或者在 <a href="https://github.com/hexojs/hexo/issues">GitHub</a> 上向我提问。</p><h2 id="快速开始"><a href="#快速开始" class="headerlink" title="快速开始"></a>快速开始</h2><h3 id="创建新文章"><a href="#创建新文章" class="headerlink" title="创建新文章"></a>创建新文章</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">$ hexo new <span class="string">&quot;My New Post&quot;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>更多信息：<a href="https://hexo.io/docs/writing.html">写作</a></p><h3 id="启动服务器"><a href="#启动服务器" class="headerlink" title="启动服务器"></a>启动服务器</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">$ hexo server</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>更多信息：<a href="https://hexo.io/docs/server.html">服务器</a></p><h3 id="生成静态文件"><a href="#生成静态文件" class="headerlink" title="生成静态文件"></a>生成静态文件</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">$ hexo generate</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>更多信息：<a href="https://hexo.io/docs/generating.html">生成文件</a></p><h3 id="部署到远程站点"><a href="#部署到远程站点" class="headerlink" title="部署到远程站点"></a>部署到远程站点</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">$ hexo deploy</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>更多信息：<a href="https://hexo.io/docs/one-command-deployment.html">部署</a></p><h1 id="Markdown-语法教程"><a href="#Markdown-语法教程" class="headerlink" title="Markdown 语法教程"></a>Markdown 语法教程</h1><p>Markdown 是一种轻量级标记语言，由 John Gruber 于 2004 年创建。它允许人们使用易读易写的纯文本格式编写文档，然后转换成有效的 HTML 文档。本教程将全面介绍 Markdown 的各种语法。</p><hr><h2 id="目录"><a href="#目录" class="headerlink" title="目录"></a>目录</h2><ol><li><a href="#1-%E6%A0%87%E9%A2%98">标题</a></li><li><a href="#2-%E6%AE%B5%E8%90%BD%E4%B8%8E%E6%8D%A2%E8%A1%8C">段落与换行</a></li><li><a href="#3-%E5%BC%BA%E8%B0%83">强调</a></li><li><a href="#4-%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8">列表</a></li><li><a href="#5-%E9%93%BE%E6%8E%A5">链接</a></li><li><a href="#6-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87">图片</a></li><li><a href="#7-%E5%BC%95%E7%94%A8">引用</a></li><li><a href="#8-%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81">代码</a></li><li><a href="#9-%E5%88%86%E9%9A%94%E7%BA%BF">分隔线</a></li><li><a href="#10-%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC">表格</a></li><li><a href="#11-%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8">任务列表</a></li><li><a href="#12-%E8%84%9A%E6%B3%A8">脚注</a></li><li><a href="#13-%E5%88%A0%E9%99%A4%E7%BA%BF">删除线</a></li><li><a href="#14-html-%E6%A0%87%E7%AD%BE">HTML 标签</a></li><li><a href="#15-%E8%BD%AC%E4%B9%89%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6">转义字符</a></li><li><a href="#16-%E6%95%B0%E5%AD%A6%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F">数学公式</a></li><li><a href="#17-%E7%9B%AE%E5%BD%95%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90">目录生成</a></li><li><a href="#18-%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E6%8A%80%E5%B7%A7">其他技巧</a></li></ol><hr><h2 id="1-标题"><a href="#1-标题" class="headerlink" title="1. 标题"></a>1. 标题</h2><p>使用 <code>#</code> 号表示标题，<code>#</code> 的数量表示标题级别（1-6 级）。</p><h3 id="语法"><a href="#语法" class="headerlink" title="语法"></a>语法</h3><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="section"># 一级标题</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="section">## 二级标题</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="section">### 三级标题</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="section">#### 四级标题</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="section">##### 五级标题</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="section">###### 六级标题</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="效果"><a href="#效果" class="headerlink" title="效果"></a>效果</h3><h1 id="一级标题"><a href="#一级标题" class="headerlink" title="一级标题"></a>一级标题</h1><h2 id="二级标题"><a href="#二级标题" class="headerlink" title="二级标题"></a>二级标题</h2><h3 id="三级标题"><a href="#三级标题" class="headerlink" title="三级标题"></a>三级标题</h3><h4 id="四级标题"><a href="#四级标题" class="headerlink" title="四级标题"></a>四级标题</h4><h5 id="五级标题"><a href="#五级标题" class="headerlink" title="五级标题"></a>五级标题</h5><h6 id="六级标题"><a href="#六级标题" class="headerlink" title="六级标题"></a>六级标题</h6><blockquote><p><strong>注意</strong>：<code>#</code> 和标题文字之间需要有一个空格。部分平台也支持在标题下方使用 <code>===</code>（一级）或 <code>---</code>（二级）的写法。</p></blockquote><hr><h2 id="2-段落与换行"><a href="#2-段落与换行" class="headerlink" title="2. 段落与换行"></a>2. 段落与换行</h2><h3 id="段落"><a href="#段落" class="headerlink" title="段落"></a>段落</h3><p>段落之间用一个空行分隔。直接回车换行在多数渲染器中不会产生新段落。</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">这是第一个段落。</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">这是第二个段落。</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="换行"><a href="#换行" class="headerlink" title="换行"></a>换行</h3><p>如果需要在段落内换行，可以在行尾添加<strong>两个或更多空格</strong>，或者使用 <code>&lt;br&gt;</code> 标签。</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">这是第一行  </span><br><span class="line">这是第二行（行尾有两个空格）</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">这是第三行<span class="language-xml"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">br</span>&gt;</span></span>这是第四行（使用 HTML 标签）</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="效果-1"><a href="#效果-1" class="headerlink" title="效果"></a>效果</h3><p>这是第一行<br>这是第二行（行尾有两个空格）</p><p>这是第三行<br>这是第四行（使用 HTML 标签）</p><hr><h2 id="3-强调"><a href="#3-强调" class="headerlink" title="3. 强调"></a>3. 强调</h2><h3 id="斜体"><a href="#斜体" class="headerlink" title="斜体"></a>斜体</h3><p>使用 <code>*</code> 或 <code>_</code> 包裹文字。</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="emphasis">*斜体文字*</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="emphasis">_斜体文字_</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>效果：<em>斜体文字</em>  <em>斜体文字</em></p><h3 id="粗体"><a href="#粗体" class="headerlink" title="粗体"></a>粗体</h3><p>使用 <code>**</code> 或 <code>__</code> 包裹文字。</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="strong">**粗体文字**</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="strong">__粗体文字__</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>效果：<strong>粗体文字</strong>  <strong>粗体文字</strong></p><h3 id="粗斜体"><a href="#粗斜体" class="headerlink" title="粗斜体"></a>粗斜体</h3><p>使用 <code>***</code> 或 <code>___</code> 包裹文字。</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="strong">**<span class="emphasis">*粗斜体文字*</span>**</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="strong">__<span class="emphasis">_粗斜体文字_</span>__</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>效果：<em><strong>粗斜体文字</strong></em>  <em><strong>粗斜体文字</strong></em></p><hr><h2 id="4-列表"><a href="#4-列表" class="headerlink" title="4. 列表"></a>4. 列表</h2><h3 id="无序列表"><a href="#无序列表" class="headerlink" title="无序列表"></a>无序列表</h3><p>使用 <code>-</code>、<code>*</code> 或 <code>+</code> 作为列表标记。</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="bullet">-</span> 项目一</span><br><span class="line"><span class="bullet">-</span> 项目二</span><br><span class="line"><span class="bullet">  -</span> 子项目一</span><br><span class="line"><span class="bullet">  -</span> 子项目二</span><br><span class="line"><span class="bullet">-</span> 项目三</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>效果：</p><ul><li>项目一</li><li>项目二<ul><li>子项目一</li><li>子项目二</li></ul></li><li>项目三</li></ul><h3 id="有序列表"><a href="#有序列表" class="headerlink" title="有序列表"></a>有序列表</h3><p>使用数字加 <code>.</code> 表示。</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="bullet">1.</span> 第一项</span><br><span class="line"><span class="bullet">2.</span> 第二项</span><br><span class="line"><span class="bullet">   1.</span> 子项一</span><br><span class="line"><span class="bullet">   2.</span> 子项二</span><br><span class="line"><span class="bullet">3.</span> 第三项</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>效果：</p><ol><li>第一项</li><li>第二项<ol><li>子项一</li><li>子项二</li></ol></li><li>第三项</li></ol><blockquote><p><strong>提示</strong>：有序列表的数字不必严格按顺序书写，渲染器会自动编号。</p></blockquote><h3 id="列表嵌套"><a href="#列表嵌套" class="headerlink" title="列表嵌套"></a>列表嵌套</h3><p>子列表需要缩进（通常 2 或 4 个空格）。</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="bullet">-</span> 第一层</span><br><span class="line"><span class="bullet">  -</span> 第二层</span><br><span class="line"><span class="bullet">    -</span> 第三层</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="5-链接"><a href="#5-链接" class="headerlink" title="5. 链接"></a>5. 链接</h2><h3 id="行内链接"><a href="#行内链接" class="headerlink" title="行内链接"></a>行内链接</h3><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">[<span class="string">链接文字</span>](<span class="link">https://www.example.com</span>)</span><br><span class="line">[<span class="string">带标题的链接</span>](<span class="link">https://www.example.com &quot;链接标题&quot;</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>效果：<a href="https://www.example.com/">链接文字</a></p><h3 id="引用式链接"><a href="#引用式链接" class="headerlink" title="引用式链接"></a>引用式链接</h3><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">[<span class="string">链接文字</span>][<span class="symbol">1</span>]</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">[<span class="symbol">1</span>]: <span class="link">https://www.example.com &quot;链接标题&quot;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="自动链接"><a href="#自动链接" class="headerlink" title="自动链接"></a>自动链接</h3><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="language-xml">&lt;https://www.example.com&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="language-xml">&lt;email@example.com&gt;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>效果：<a href="https://www.example.com/">https://www.example.com</a></p><h3 id="锚点链接"><a href="#锚点链接" class="headerlink" title="锚点链接"></a>锚点链接</h3><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">[<span class="string">跳转到标题</span>](<span class="link">#1-标题</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="6-图片"><a href="#6-图片" class="headerlink" title="6. 图片"></a>6. 图片</h2><h3 id="基本语法"><a href="#基本语法" class="headerlink" title="基本语法"></a>基本语法</h3><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">![<span class="string">替代文字</span>](<span class="link">图片地址</span>)</span><br><span class="line">![<span class="string">替代文字</span>](<span class="link">图片地址 &quot;图片标题&quot;</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="示例"><a href="#示例" class="headerlink" title="示例"></a>示例</h3><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">![<span class="string">Markdown Logo</span>](<span class="link">https://markdown-here.com/img/icon256.png &quot;Markdown 图标&quot;</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>效果：</p><p><img src="https://markdown-here.com/img/icon256.png" alt="Markdown Logo" title="Markdown 图标"></p><h3 id="引用式图片"><a href="#引用式图片" class="headerlink" title="引用式图片"></a>引用式图片</h3><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">![<span class="string">替代文字</span>][<span class="symbol">logo</span>]</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">[<span class="symbol">logo</span>]: <span class="link">https://markdown-here.com/img/icon256.png &quot;图片标题&quot;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="带链接的图片"><a href="#带链接的图片" class="headerlink" title="带链接的图片"></a>带链接的图片</h3><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">[<span class="string">![替代文字</span>](<span class="link">图片地址</span>)](<span class="link">链接地址</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="7-引用"><a href="#7-引用" class="headerlink" title="7. 引用"></a>7. 引用</h2><p>使用 <code>&gt;</code> 表示引用，可以嵌套。</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="quote">&gt; 这是一段引用文字。</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="quote">&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="quote">&gt; 这是引用的第二段。</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="quote">&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="quote">&gt; &gt; 这是嵌套引用。</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>效果：</p><blockquote><p>这是一段引用文字。</p><p>这是引用的第二段。</p><blockquote><p>这是嵌套引用。</p></blockquote></blockquote><h3 id="引用中嵌套其他元素"><a href="#引用中嵌套其他元素" class="headerlink" title="引用中嵌套其他元素"></a>引用中嵌套其他元素</h3><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="quote">&gt; #### 引用中的标题</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="quote">&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="quote">&gt; - 列表项一</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="quote">&gt; - 列表项二</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="quote">&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="quote">&gt; <span class="strong">**粗体文字**</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="8-代码"><a href="#8-代码" class="headerlink" title="8. 代码"></a>8. 代码</h2><h3 id="行内代码"><a href="#行内代码" class="headerlink" title="行内代码"></a>行内代码</h3><p>使用反引号 <code>`</code> 包裹。</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">使用 <span class="code">`console.log()`</span> 输出日志。</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>效果：使用 <code>console.log()</code> 输出日志。</p><h3 id="代码块"><a href="#代码块" class="headerlink" title="代码块"></a>代码块</h3><p>使用三个反引号包裹，可以指定语言以启用语法高亮。</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="code">```javascript</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="code">function greet(name) &#123;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="code">  console.log(`Hello, $&#123;name&#125;!`);</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="code">&#125;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="code">greet(&#x27;World&#x27;);</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="code">```</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>效果：</p><figure class="highlight javascript"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">function</span> <span class="title function_">greet</span>(<span class="params">name</span>) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="variable language_">console</span>.<span class="title function_">log</span>(<span class="string">`Hello, <span class="subst">$&#123;name&#125;</span>!`</span>);</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="title function_">greet</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;World&#x27;</span>);</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="缩进式代码块"><a href="#缩进式代码块" class="headerlink" title="缩进式代码块"></a>缩进式代码块</h3><p>使用 4 个空格或 1 个制表符缩进。</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">function hello() &#123;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="code">    return &quot;Hello&quot;;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="code">&#125;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><blockquote><p><strong>提示</strong>：代码块中如需显示反引号，可使用更多数量的反引号包裹（如四个反引号）。</p></blockquote><hr><h2 id="9-分隔线"><a href="#9-分隔线" class="headerlink" title="9. 分隔线"></a>9. 分隔线</h2><p>使用三个或以上的 <code>*</code>、<code>-</code> 或 <code>_</code> 单独成行。</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">---</span><br><span class="line">***</span><br><span class="line">___</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>效果：</p><hr><hr><hr><blockquote><p><strong>注意</strong>：分隔线前后需要空行，避免与标题语法冲突。</p></blockquote><hr><h2 id="10-表格"><a href="#10-表格" class="headerlink" title="10. 表格"></a>10. 表格</h2><p>使用 <code>|</code> 分隔列，使用 <code>-</code> 分隔表头与内容。<code>:</code> 用于控制对齐方式。</p><h3 id="基本语法-1"><a href="#基本语法-1" class="headerlink" title="基本语法"></a>基本语法</h3><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">| 姓名 | 年龄 | 城市 |</span><br><span class="line">| ---- | ---- | ---- |</span><br><span class="line">| 张三 | 25 | 北京 |</span><br><span class="line">| 李四 | 30 | 上海 |</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>效果：</p><table><thead><tr><th>姓名</th><th>年龄</th><th>城市</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>张三</td><td>25</td><td>北京</td></tr><tr><td>李四</td><td>30</td><td>上海</td></tr></tbody></table><h3 id="对齐方式"><a href="#对齐方式" class="headerlink" title="对齐方式"></a>对齐方式</h3><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">| 左对齐 | 居中对齐 | 右对齐 |</span><br><span class="line">| :----- | :------: | -----: |</span><br><span class="line">| 内容1 | 内容2 | 内容3 |</span><br><span class="line">| 内容4 | 内容5 | 内容6 |</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>效果：</p><table><thead><tr><th align="left">左对齐</th><th align="center">居中对齐</th><th align="right">右对齐</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left">内容1</td><td align="center">内容2</td><td align="right">内容3</td></tr><tr><td align="left">内容4</td><td align="center">内容5</td><td align="right">内容6</td></tr></tbody></table><h3 id="表格中的格式化"><a href="#表格中的格式化" class="headerlink" title="表格中的格式化"></a>表格中的格式化</h3><p>表格单元格内可以使用加粗、斜体、代码等语法，但换行需使用 <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>。</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">| 语法 | 说明 |</span><br><span class="line">| ---- | ---- |</span><br><span class="line">| <span class="code">`**粗体**`</span> | <span class="strong">**粗体**</span> |</span><br><span class="line">| <span class="code">`*斜体*`</span> | <span class="emphasis">*斜体*</span> |</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="11-任务列表"><a href="#11-任务列表" class="headerlink" title="11. 任务列表"></a>11. 任务列表</h2><p>使用 <code>- [ ]</code> 表示未完成任务，<code>- [x]</code> 表示已完成任务。</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="bullet">-</span> [x] 完成任务一</span><br><span class="line"><span class="bullet">-</span> [ ] 完成任务二</span><br><span class="line"><span class="bullet">-</span> [ ] 完成任务三</span><br><span class="line"><span class="bullet">  -</span> [x] 子任务一</span><br><span class="line"><span class="bullet">  -</span> [ ] 子任务二</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>效果：</p><ul><li><input checked="" disabled="" type="checkbox"> 完成任务一</li><li><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> 完成任务二</li><li><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> 完成任务三<ul><li><input checked="" disabled="" type="checkbox"> 子任务一</li><li><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> 子任务二</li></ul></li></ul><blockquote><p><strong>注意</strong>：任务列表在 GitHub、Typora 等平台支持良好，并非所有 Markdown 渲染器都支持。</p></blockquote><hr><h2 id="12-脚注"><a href="#12-脚注" class="headerlink" title="12. 脚注"></a>12. 脚注</h2><p>使用 <code>[^标识]</code> 定义脚注引用和内容。</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">这是一段带有脚注的文字[^1]。</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">[<span class="symbol">^1</span>]: <span class="link">这里是脚注的内容。</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>效果：</p><p>这是一段带有脚注的文字<a href="%E8%BF%99%E9%87%8C%E6%98%AF%E8%84%9A%E6%B3%A8%E7%9A%84%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E3%80%82">^1</a>。</p><hr><h2 id="13-删除线"><a href="#13-删除线" class="headerlink" title="13. 删除线"></a>13. 删除线</h2><p>使用 <code>~~</code> 包裹文字。</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">~~删除线文字~~</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>效果：<del>删除线文字</del></p><hr><h2 id="14-HTML-标签"><a href="#14-HTML-标签" class="headerlink" title="14. HTML 标签"></a>14. HTML 标签</h2><p>Markdown 支持内嵌 HTML 标签，可实现更多样式。</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="language-xml"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">u</span>&gt;</span></span>下划线文字<span class="language-xml"><span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">u</span>&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="language-xml"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">mark</span>&gt;</span></span>高亮文字<span class="language-xml"><span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">mark</span>&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="language-xml"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">sup</span>&gt;</span></span>上标<span class="language-xml"><span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">sup</span>&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="language-xml"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">sub</span>&gt;</span></span>下标<span class="language-xml"><span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">sub</span>&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="language-xml"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">kbd</span>&gt;</span></span>Ctrl<span class="language-xml"><span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">kbd</span>&gt;</span></span> + <span class="language-xml"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">kbd</span>&gt;</span></span>C<span class="language-xml"><span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">kbd</span>&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="language-xml"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">center</span>&gt;</span></span>居中文字<span class="language-xml"><span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">center</span>&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="language-xml"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">details</span>&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="language-xml"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">summary</span>&gt;</span></span>点击展开<span class="language-xml"><span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">summary</span>&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class="line">这里是隐藏的内容。</span><br><span class="line"><span class="language-xml"><span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">details</span>&gt;</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>效果：</p><p><u>下划线文字</u></p><p><mark>高亮文字</mark></p><p>上标：x<sup>2</sup>　下标：H<sub>2</sub>O</p><p>按键：<kbd>Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>C</kbd></p><details><summary>点击展开</summary>这里是隐藏的内容。</details><hr><h2 id="15-转义字符"><a href="#15-转义字符" class="headerlink" title="15. 转义字符"></a>15. 转义字符</h2><p>使用反斜杠 <code>\</code> 转义 Markdown 特殊字符。</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">\<span class="emphasis">*这不是斜体\*</span></span><br><span class="line">\# 这不是标题</span><br><span class="line">\[这不是链接\]</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>效果：</p><p>*这不是斜体*</p><p># 这不是标题</p><p>[这不是链接]</p><h3 id="可转义的字符"><a href="#可转义的字符" class="headerlink" title="可转义的字符"></a>可转义的字符</h3><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">\   反斜杠</span><br><span class="line">`   反引号</span><br><span class="line">*   星号</span><br><span class="line">_   下划线</span><br><span class="line">&#123;&#125;  花括号</span><br><span class="line">[]  方括号</span><br><span class="line">()  圆括号</span><br><span class="line">#   井号</span><br><span class="line">+   加号</span><br><span class="line">-   减号</span><br><span class="line">.   点</span><br><span class="line">!   感叹号</span><br><span class="line">|   竖线</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="16-数学公式"><a href="#16-数学公式" class="headerlink" title="16. 数学公式"></a>16. 数学公式</h2><p>部分渲染器（如 Typora、GitHub、Obsidian）支持 LaTeX 数学公式。</p><h3 id="行内公式"><a href="#行内公式" class="headerlink" title="行内公式"></a>行内公式</h3><p>使用 <code>$...$</code> 包裹。</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">质能方程：$E = mc^2$</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>效果：质能方程：$E &#x3D; mc^2$</p><h3 id="块级公式"><a href="#块级公式" class="headerlink" title="块级公式"></a>块级公式</h3><p>使用 <code>$$...$$</code> 包裹。</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">$$</span><br><span class="line">\int<span class="emphasis">_&#123;a&#125;^&#123;b&#125; f(x) \, dx = F(b) - F(a)</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="emphasis">$$</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>效果：</p><p>$$<br>\int_{a}^{b} f(x) , dx &#x3D; F(b) - F(a)<br>$$</p><hr><h2 id="17-目录生成"><a href="#17-目录生成" class="headerlink" title="17. 目录生成"></a>17. 目录生成</h2><p>部分平台（如 Typora、GitHub）支持使用 <code>[TOC]</code> 自动生成目录。</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">[TOC]</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><blockquote><p><strong>说明</strong>：不同平台对目录生成的支持不同，GitHub 不直接支持 <code>[TOC]</code>，但会为标题自动生成锚点。</p></blockquote><hr><h2 id="18-其他技巧"><a href="#18-其他技巧" class="headerlink" title="18. 其他技巧"></a>18. 其他技巧</h2><h3 id="18-1-折叠内容"><a href="#18-1-折叠内容" class="headerlink" title="18.1 折叠内容"></a>18.1 折叠内容</h3><p>使用 HTML 的 <code>&lt;details&gt;</code> 和 <code>&lt;summary&gt;</code> 标签。</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="language-xml"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">details</span>&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="language-xml"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">summary</span>&gt;</span></span>展开查看答案<span class="language-xml"><span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">summary</span>&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">这里是答案内容。</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="language-xml"><span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">details</span>&gt;</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="18-2-注释"><a href="#18-2-注释" class="headerlink" title="18.2 注释"></a>18.2 注释</h3><p>Markdown 中可使用 HTML 注释。</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">&lt;!-- 这是注释，不会显示在渲染结果中 --&gt;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="18-3-换行技巧"><a href="#18-3-换行技巧" class="headerlink" title="18.3 换行技巧"></a>18.3 换行技巧</h3><ul><li>段落间空行</li><li>行尾两个空格换行</li><li><code>&lt;br&gt;</code> 强制换行</li></ul><h3 id="18-4-徽章（Badge）"><a href="#18-4-徽章（Badge）" class="headerlink" title="18.4 徽章（Badge）"></a>18.4 徽章（Badge）</h3><p>常用于 README 文件。</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">![<span class="string">Build Status</span>](<span class="link">https://img.shields.io/badge/build-passing-brightgreen</span>)</span><br><span class="line">![<span class="string">Version</span>](<span class="link">https://img.shields.io/badge/version-1.0.0-blue</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="18-5-表情符号"><a href="#18-5-表情符号" class="headerlink" title="18.5 表情符号"></a>18.5 表情符号</h3><p>支持 Emoji 短代码（部分平台）。</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">:smile: :rocket: :heart: :+1:</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>效果：:smile: :rocket: :heart: :+1:</p><h3 id="18-6-定义列表"><a href="#18-6-定义列表" class="headerlink" title="18.6 定义列表"></a>18.6 定义列表</h3><p>部分渲染器支持。</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">术语一</span><br><span class="line">: 定义一</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">术语二</span><br><span class="line">: 定义二</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="18-7-引用中的代码与列表"><a href="#18-7-引用中的代码与列表" class="headerlink" title="18.7 引用中的代码与列表"></a>18.7 引用中的代码与列表</h3><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="quote">&gt; 引用文字</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="quote">&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="quote">&gt; ```js</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="quote">&gt; console.log(&#x27;hello&#x27;);</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><blockquote><ul><li>列表项</li></ul></blockquote><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">### 18.8 锚点跳转</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">标题会自动生成锚点，规则通常是：小写、空格替换为 `-`、去除特殊字符。</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">```markdown</span><br><span class="line">[回到顶部](#markdown-语法教程)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="附：常用-Markdown-编辑器推荐"><a href="#附：常用-Markdown-编辑器推荐" class="headerlink" title="附：常用 Markdown 编辑器推荐"></a>附：常用 Markdown 编辑器推荐</h2><table><thead><tr><th>编辑器</th><th>平台</th><th>特点</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Typora</td><td>Windows&#x2F;macOS&#x2F;Linux</td><td>所见即所得</td></tr><tr><td>Obsidian</td><td>全平台</td><td>知识管理</td></tr><tr><td>VS Code</td><td>全平台</td><td>插件丰富</td></tr><tr><td>Mark Text</td><td>全平台</td><td>开源免费</td></tr><tr><td>Notion</td><td>Web&#x2F;客户端</td><td>协作方便</td></tr></tbody></table><hr><h2 id="附：Markdown-规范与扩展"><a href="#附：Markdown-规范与扩展" class="headerlink" title="附：Markdown 规范与扩展"></a>附：Markdown 规范与扩展</h2><ul><li><strong>CommonMark</strong>：标准化的 Markdown 规范</li><li>**GFM (GitHub Flavored Markdown)**：GitHub 扩展，支持表格、任务列表、删除线等</li><li><strong>Markdown Extra</strong>：支持脚注、定义列表、表格等扩展</li></ul><hr><h2 id="总结"><a href="#总结" class="headerlink" title="总结"></a>总结</h2><p>Markdown 语法简洁易学，核心语法包括：</p><ul><li><strong>标题</strong>：<code>#</code></li><li><strong>强调</strong>：<code>*</code>、<code>**</code>、<code>***</code></li><li><strong>列表</strong>：<code>-</code>、<code>1.</code></li><li><strong>链接</strong>：<code>[文字](地址)</code></li><li><strong>图片</strong>：<code>![替代](地址)</code></li><li><strong>引用</strong>：<code>&gt;</code></li><li><strong>代码</strong>：<code>`</code>、<code> </code> &#96;&#96;</li><li><strong>表格</strong>：<code>|</code></li><li><strong>分隔线</strong>：<code>---</code></li></ul><hr>]]></content>
      
      
      
